vided message."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC is only supported on iPhones from iPhone 6 and forward. It will not work on iPads since there’s no NFC chip in these devices."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC connection to a YubiKey (iOS only)."}]},{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFCSmartCardConnection establishes a connection to a YubiKey via NFC. The connection"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents the system NFC dialog and waits for the user to tap their YubiKey."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC connections are short-lived due to iOS timeout constraints. Perform operations quickly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and close the connection with a user-visible message."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(","    alertMessage: \"Hold your YubiKey near the phone\"",")","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()","await connection.close(message: \"Codes retrieved\")"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A NFC connection to the YubiKey."}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Creating a SmartCardConnection to a YubiKey","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/SmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/USBSmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LightningSmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WiredSmartCardConnection"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Creating-a-SmartCardConnection-to-a-YubiKey"}],"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/NFCSmartCa